{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted","id":1207838,"title":"Where are All the Druggie Exalted?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-16T19:07:59-07:00","id":1207838,"title":"Where are All the Druggie Exalted?","content":"I've been reading a great deal of Chinese webnovels and I've noticed a few major parts of the genre that Exalted seem to ignore completely.<br /> <br /> First off:<br /> - You should be able to tell whether someone should become a Dragon-Blood by the time they're five. Honestly, the business with Anikin's mitochondria in Star Wars: Episode 1: The Phantom Menace was fits better with xanxia than Exalted. You just take a prick of someone blood and can tell whether they'll be the most powerful Peerless Master ever because the awesome levels in their blood are so high.<br /> <br /> - You unlock your essence through taking massive amounts of drugs. Working hard, meditating for a hundred years, and otherwise reaching any sort of enlightenment is for NPCs. If you are the MC, some old dude gives you pills and you pop as many of them as you can, like you're some junky in need of a fix. That way you can reach your MC levels of power in record time.<br /> <br /> - The levels of Exaltation need to be clearly labeled and identified, and five is no longer sufficient. Because I'm a giver, I've decided to offer a more evocative Exaltation level for Dragon-Blooded. From least to most powerful:<br /> <br /> Ess 1 -<br /> Talon<br /> Martial Talon<br /> Martial Talon Master<br /> Elemental Martial Talon Master<br /> Elemental Heavenly Talon Master<br /> <br /> Ess 2-<br /> Dragon Saint<br /> Martial Dragon Saint<br /> Elemental Heavenly Dragon Saint<br /> True Elemental Heavenly Dragon Saint<br /> True Elemental Heavenly Dragon Saint, rank II<br /> <br /> Ess 3 -<br /> Thundering Coiling Demigod<br /> Heavenly Thundering Coiling Demigod<br /> Elementally Infused Heavenly Thundering Coiling Demigod<br /> Righteous Master Elementally Infused Heavenly Thundering Coiling Demigod<br /> <br /> Ess 4 -<br /> Supreme Dragon of Heaven<br /> Even more Supreme Dragon of Heaven<br /> Really fucking Supreme Dragon of Heaven<br /> Holy-Shit, I Can't Believe it's Not Supreme Dragon of Heaven<br /> Saint Holy-Shit, I can't Believe it's Not Supreme Dragon of Heaven<br /> <br /> Ess 5 - (There can only be one of these in existence of each element at a time. This is the HIGHEST LEVEL OF DRAGON - BLOODED POWER AVAILABLE)<br /> Raging Inferno Dragon-Lord of the South<br /> Icy Blizzard Dragon-Lord of the North<br /> Crashing Typhoon Dragon-Lord of the West<br /> Flowering Blossom Dragon-Lord of the East<br /> Enduring Mountain Dragon-Lord of the Center<br /> <br /> Ess 6 - This is the secret level your PC unlocks by popping pills and entering <b>up</b>, <b>up</b>, <b>down</b>, <b>down</b>, <b>left</b>, <b>right</b>, <b>left</b>, <b>right</b>, B, A in their console. <br /> The Perfected Elemental Saint Avatar of Creation<br /> <br /> Okay, that's for the Dragon-Bloods, I'm sure the writers can do this for all the other exalted.<br /> <br /> Anyways, lets see these important corrections in some patch notes or something, and then we can work on the minor stuff like the coughing blood and how all romance needs to involve rape.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T19:44:05-07:00","id":1207847,"title":"","content":"You forgot to include how lately a <i>staggering </i>number of Exalt prodigies turn out to be reincarnations of people from another world. Only a matter of time until the rise of House or Gens Isekai...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T20:04:01-07:00","id":1207851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1207847#post1207847\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You forgot to include how lately a <i>staggering </i>number of Exalt prodigies turn out to be reincarnations of people from another world. Only a matter of time until the rise of House or Gens Isekai...</div> </div> </div> </div>Though that is more japanese than chinese, no? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T20:37:24-07:00","id":1207861,"title":"","content":"Are we talking coughing blood because you got hit really hard or coughing blood as the only symptom of your unspecified terminal disease? Because Exalted can't die from disease.<br /> <br /> On the main topic, have you checked in Great Forks? Now that Exigents are a thing I bet you anything that's where the Chosen of Weed hangs out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T21:39:19-07:00","id":1207879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1207851#post1207851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Though that is more japanese than chinese, no? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That's why we have Lookshy, my friend!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12778-rustedair","name":"RustedAir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-16T21:44:09-07:00","id":1207881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RustedAir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1207879#post1207879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's why we have Lookshy, my friend!</div> </div> </div> </div>Lookshy is more of a &quot;Winners Don't Do Drugs&quot; kind of place, afaik, so that might complicate matters. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, no one saying anything about Orgiastic Fugitive Style or a return of it? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T00:19:31-07:00","id":1207907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1207851#post1207851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Though that is more japanese than chinese, no? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure about xianxia novels, but it has &quot;contaminated&quot; a <b>lot </b>of Chinese manhua* too (actually, I don't know were the trend started). I know I've had trouble finding fantasy + martial arts** manga/manhua that are not about reincarnating in another world lately.<br /> <br /> <br /> *<span style=\"font-size:9px\">And those are often based on novels.<br /> <br /> ** And, of course, for fantasy in general you have reincarnation into another world, summoned into another world, reincarnated or somehow stuck inside a virtual reality MMO and so on...</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T06:58:13-07:00","id":1207969,"title":"","content":"This is a 2.5 observation, rather than a 3Ed one, but consider Celestial Cocaine, as it truly is a Sidereal\u2019s best friend. Seriously, it\u2019s so useful that it would have to seriously clash with the character concept for me not to recommend it for anyone statting out a new Vizier. Easily available in Yu Shan, Celestial Cocaine grants +1 boosts to Dexterity, Stamina, and Intelligence for 5+ hours, and gives you All Encompassing Sorcerer\u2019s Sight for the same duration. Sure, there is some auto-damage, the -3 crash penalty is a bit of a damper, and the increasing likelihood of addiction is problematic for most, but a simple Duck Fate renders all 3 things things entirely academic. <br /> <br /> If 10 motes for the above boosts is too rich for your blood (and it shouldn\u2019t be), you can always go an unorthodox route, such as seeking out or crafting an Artifact straw/razor/mirror kit that reduces or nullifies the penalties, dating Burning Feather, Goddess of Intoxicants, or arguing that the crash at the end of the high is a condition unto itself, and thus eligible to be shaken off (and weaponized) with Somebody Else\u2019s Destiny.<br /> <br /> We now return you to your Sidereal-free 3rd Edition. Only Akuma use drugs. Stay in school.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T07:29:40-07:00","id":1207979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted#post1207838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> - You unlock your essence through taking massive amounts of drugs. Working hard, meditating for a hundred years, and otherwise reaching any sort of enlightenment is for NPCs. If you are the MC, some old dude gives you pills and you pop as many of them as you can, like you're some junky in need of a fix. That way you can reach your MC levels of power in record time.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Or you break into Heaven and steal the pills from the Five Immortals. That's not uncommon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T07:36:29-07:00","id":1207981,"title":"","content":"Courtship between Exalted involves years of separation while one party proves their worth to the other party's far more powerful family. <br /> <br /> Reaching Essence 6 requires months spent in a sort of meditative coma, allowing Exalted to ignore conflicts entirely and just win at the last minute without doing any of the important work. <br /> <br /> No matter how many times they're explored, First Age ruins will always be full of loot. <br /> <br /> Exalted can never create their own charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T08:50:04-07:00","id":1207999,"title":"","content":"This entire thread hurts, you are all bad, and you should all feel bad. <span style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Obviously I am not being serious here, please continue.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5771-krata-lightblade","name":"Krata Lightblade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5771_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T10:59:28-07:00","id":1208070,"title":"","content":"I'm so confused.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T11:03:04-07:00","id":1208072,"title":"","content":"In Scroll of the Monk - IIRC - there's the drug and alcohol based MA<br /> <br /> and &quot;The Slug&quot; was a wood-aspected DB from 2. Ed who was basically jabba the hutt who was always on drugs due to a crippling injury.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T11:48:21-07:00","id":1208090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1208072#post1208072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and &quot;The Slug&quot; was a wood-aspected DB from 2. Ed who was basically jabba the hutt who was always on drugs due to a crippling injury.</div> </div> </div> </div>First and Second Editions - he was 1e's iconic Wood Aspect, and was one of the viewpoint characters in Aspect Book: Wood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T12:16:05-07:00","id":1208099,"title":"","content":"Oh, and sometimes your love will die, and later you'll meet someone who... looks exactly like them? And... it's something like parallel reincarnation? I don't really understand that at all.<br /> <br /> Also, the Monkey King should turn up in at least a third of games.<br /> (At one point, I was watching three different Wuxia shows on TV, and<i> all</i> of them had the Monkey King in. None were Journey to the West.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T12:19:40-07:00","id":1208101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted#post1207838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyways, lets see these important corrections in some patch notes or something, and then we can work on the minor stuff like the coughing blood and how all romance needs to involve rape.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>In Wuxia shows it doesn't normally involve rape (I mean, occasionally, but sex, whether consensual or not, isn't normally shown or implied, except by filthy innuendo-based jokes, due to censorship. Which is why I was sometimes very confused when female characters suddenly turned out to have been pregnant for several weeks, without any implication of sex up until that point).<br /> (... and it might well involve a bit of sexual assault, just not rape.)<br /> <br /> But it does always involve strong female characters (generally more likeable and interesting characters than the males) suddenly turning into emotional wrecks who spend all their time crying because the male protagonist or secondary protagonist doesn't love them, or has been mind-controlled to be evil, or was actually evil all along but got split into good and evil versions with amnesia but now it turns out he's the villain's lieutenant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T13:57:57-07:00","id":1208162,"title":"","content":"The local magistrate is always corrupt. If he seems like a nice guy then he's just being tricked by his corrupt vizer.<br /> <br /> The local peasantry is being oppressed. If they look happy and say everything is fine don't believe them - they're really being oppressed and anyone who tells you that will be killed. <br /> <br /> If you see an old man, be very polite and respectful because he's probably some sort of martial art master. In manhua only badass martial artists seem to live to old age. <br /> <br /> If you see a young child, be extra polite and careful. He's probably an old man who was so badass he punched time until it finally agreed to de-age him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 04-17-2018, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T21:23:23-07:00","id":1208314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1207861#post1207861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are we talking coughing blood because you got hit really hard or coughing blood as the only symptom of your unspecified terminal disease? Because Exalted can't die from disease.</div> </div> </div> </div>Coughing blood as a reaction to anything.<br /> <br /> Coughing blood because injury:<br /> <br /> &quot;The white clothed boy did not make any effort to dodge. As Xing Jue approached him, the corner of his lips curled into a sneer. He shot out his fist, which with the power of his invisible Qi hit Xing Jue\u2019s body hard. \u201cCough!\u201d<br /> Instantly blood spurted from Xing Jue\u2019s mouth. His body felt like a kite with broken string, sailing up high, only to fall down hard on the tyrannical ground.&quot;<br /> <br /> Coughing blood because you're surprised!:<br /> <br /> &quot;Looking at the items in the old man\u2019s hand, Xing Jue has almost spewed up a mouthful of blood. This event is too shocking for him. &quot;<br /> <br /> Coughing blood because you made a bad decision:<br /> <br /> &quot;If the elders and instructors of Xing Clan found out about his present achievements, they would certainly vomit blood from regret. For a young man with such cultivation talent, the future was limitless.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T21:44:44-07:00","id":1208318,"title":"","content":"It would be hard to make exalted into a xianxia because the DB live in a matriarchy an as we all know women arent fit for cultivation and only one out of every ten cultivators is a woman. (A very beautiful woman, that looks like an immortal goddess that came down from an immortal mountain wearing an immortal robe that shows off her immortal curves)<br /> <br /> But if you do, remember to give a free N/A artifact to all players at the start of the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1351,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","user":"Sakii","date":". 04-18-2018, 12:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T22:15:58-07:00","id":1208324,"title":"","content":"Did anyone else find that cultivation was generally described as &quot;cultivating his conduct&quot; in their translations?<br /> <br /> It always made me imagine the immortals on mountains were having elocution and etiquette classes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T03:59:12-07:00","id":1208387,"title":"","content":"Don't forget the 3000-year old virgins who stay &quot;pure&quot; (as a rule they never ever masturbate) until they finally get together with their childhood love whom they last met 2990 years ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T05:59:20-07:00","id":1208408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted#post1207838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, that's for the Dragon-Bloods, I'm sure the writers can do this for all the other exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Solar</b>: As a scion of a powerful Dragonblood gens, you were expected to exalt early, but due to shenanigans didn't, and so became scorned as trash. However after years of bullying and deprivation, you managed to exalt anyway, though you are still constantly underestimated because you hide the nature and extent from your Dragonblood peers for <i>reasons</i>.<br /> <br /> <b>Lunar</b>: You are the Solar's pet monster who later learned to take human form. Shut up. Yes you are.<br /> <br /> \u200b<b>Sidereal</b>: You are a nobody from the boondocks whom was never expected to amount to much, but due to a fateful encounter exalt and discover you are a Favoured Son of the Heavens. Which is less of a blessing than it sounds, as it means you have to save the world from constant doomsday plots while seemingly <i>everyone </i>wants to kill you.<br /> <br /> <b>\u200bAbyssal</b>: You have died due to the connivance of your despised sibling from another mother, but returned from the grave with powers to seek veangeance on your family, your kingdom, and the world. What. Resonance is supposed to be a bad thing?<br /> <br /> \u200b<b>Infernal</b><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">: You have made a pact with a &quot;mysterious spiritual advisor&quot; and learned forbidden secret arts. You shall use your devilish powers wisely... hehehe<i>m</i></span></span></span><i>uhahaha!</i><br /> <br /> <b>Liminal</b>: A meek teenaged girl died and you have come from another world to reanimate their corpse, using her memories to masqurade (badly) while using your grave powers to seek veangeance on her behalf. You almost immediately form a mysterious bond with an sociopathic badboy stalker who has a bizarre attraction to murderous young girls; which you think is romantic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-18T07:28:04-07:00","id":1208431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Greyman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1208408#post1208408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Lunar</b>: You are the Solar's pet monster who later learned to take human form. Shut up. Yes you are.</div> </div> </div> </div>You broke pattern here by describing a secondary rather than main character.<br /> <br /> Therefore I presume you haven\u2019t read Re:Monster, which is a buffet of these trashy tropes. It\u2019s a reincarnation isekai where a magically-genetically engineered super-soldier mercenary from earth is murdered in the street by a yandere stalker.<br /> <br /> He\u2019s reborn into a stereotypical Japanese DnD fantasy world as a rare black goblin born of one woman of several kept captive for the purpose by a band of goblins. He will go on to be a rapist himself when he\u2019s powerful enough to conquer kingdoms and drug resisting women. <br /> <br /> In order to get that far, he will use the skills he brought with him from his previous life, but especially the magical-genetic power he also had: eating corpses to gain their biological strengths. Which in this world includes magical talent.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s a garbage story, and very boring.<br /> <br /> A much better story is Spirit Migration. It\u2019s set in a similar world, but the protagonist might not be from another world. He has no memories at all, and is a disembodied spirit which can possess natural and magical beasts. Whenever confronted by a stronger beast, he simply jumps ship and (when necessary) kills the previous weaker one.<br /> <br /> Instead of a meandering and pointless story about acquiring personal power, wealth, and sex slaves, Spirit Migration is about the mortal people living, dying, and scheming in the world, and how the Migrating Spirit tries to help them as an outsider predator of great power and compassion. <br /> <br /> At one point, the hero leaves the dungeon entirely to help a little girl solve a family mystery in the bodies of her pet bird and dog.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 04-18-2018, 10:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T07:34:14-07:00","id":1208854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1208431#post1208431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It\u2019s a reincarnation isekai where a magically-genetically engineered super-soldier mercenary from earth is murdered in the street by a yandere stalker.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why is he a genetically engineered supersoldier if he's just going to get reincarnated anyway? Doesn't that defeat the entire point of isekai?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1369-mewtarthio","name":"Mewtarthio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-19T07:40:00-07:00","id":1208856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mewtarthio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1207838-where-are-all-the-druggie-exalted?p=1208854#post1208854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why is he a genetically engineered supersoldier if he's just going to get reincarnated anyway? Doesn't that defeat the entire point of isekai?</div> </div> </div> </div>The whole thing is pointless, boring garbage.<br /> <br /> Spirit Migration is a much better manga, with a likeable protagonist and a supporting cast which is treated with respect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}